    "rich_text_TceXRJ": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_VGfJ63": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h1>Premium Outdoor Décor by Salt Sun Sand</h1><p>At <strong>Salt Sun Sand</strong>, we take pride in offering premium outdoor décor designed to elevate your lifestyle and transform your outdoor spaces. With over <strong>23 years of experience</strong> in designing and importing high-quality outdoor accessories, we understand the unique demands of the Australian climate — and the importance of combining <strong>style, comfort</strong>, and <strong>durability</strong>.</p><h3>Quality Outdoor Cushions</h3><p>When it comes to <strong>outdoor cushions</strong>, quality is everything. Our cushions are crafted using <strong>solution-dyed fabrics</strong> that are <strong>fade-resistant, water-repellent</strong>, and <strong>mildew-resistant</strong>, making them ideal for patios, decks, balconies, and poolside settings.</p><p>Each cushion features <strong>piped edges</strong> and <strong>premium stitching</strong>, ensuring a tailored finish and long-lasting performance. Whether you're creating a relaxed coastal retreat or a vibrant entertaining zone, our outdoor cushions bring designer flair and resilience to any setting — built to withstand the elements and look beautiful year after year.</p><h3>Outdoor Rug Collection</h3><p>Looking to layer your space with comfort and texture? Our <strong>outdoor rug collection</strong> is designed to transform any area into a warm, stylish retreat. With <strong>ten captivating designs</strong>, each rug combines form and function to enhance your outdoor décor.</p><p>Made with sustainability in mind, our rugs are crafted from <strong>recyclable materials</strong> and are just as suitable for indoor use as they are for alfresco living. Add personality, comfort, and durability to your patio, balcony, or garden lounge.</p><h3>Outdoor Wall Art</h3><p>Make a statement with <strong>Salt Sun Sand’s outdoor wall art</strong> — the perfect way to inject personality and artistic flair into your garden, courtyard, or entertaining space. Our collection includes everything from <strong>tropical bursts of colour</strong> to <strong>calming coastal scenes</strong>, allowing you to personalise your outdoor space with ease.</p><p>Designed to withstand the outdoors, each piece is weatherproof, fade-resistant, and equally at home indoors or out.</p><p>Turn plain walls into focal points and bring your outdoor décor to life with artistic charm.</p><h3>Outdoor Bean Bag Collection</h3><p><strong>Introducing our vibrant new collection of outdoor bean bags</strong> — the latest in comfort-led outdoor living. Designed to blend <strong>style, durability</strong>, and <strong>functionality</strong>, these bean bags are perfect for relaxing in the sun or entertaining guests in comfort.</p><p>Crafted with the <strong>harsh Australian climate in mind</strong>, our bean bags feature durable, weather-ready fabrics built to survive the elements.</p><p>With trending colours and contemporary shapes, these bean bags are made to stand out — and to last. Whether poolside, on the deck, or under your favourite tree, our outdoor bean bags bring a new level of laid-back luxury to your space.</p><h3>Create Your Outdoor Retreat</h3><p>From <strong>outdoor cushions</strong>, <strong>rugs</strong>, and <strong>wall art</strong> to our newest range of <strong>bean bags</strong>, Salt Sun Sand offers everything you need to create a beautiful, comfortable, and functional outdoor space. Each piece is designed with longevity, style, and the Australian lifestyle in mind — so you can enjoy your outdoor retreat all year round.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
